                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A brutal turn-based dungeon crawler where your primary survival strategy is watching your heavily geared squad slowly starve to death while trapped in a damp sewer tube. You spend every turn meticulously balancing your microscopic supply of bandages and soup, only to watch a giant rat critically hit your main fighter and wipe out three hours of careful navigation in two seconds. It is a delightfully claustrophobic stress test of inventory management, harsh rng, and relentless underground despair where every victory feels like a miracle and every defeat feels entirely earned.",
